  "body": "## Hotfix v2.0.3 - F10/F11 Diagnostics\n\n### Added\n- Diagnostic logging to identify why F10/F11 hotkeys don't respond\n- Logging shows which input system works (Legacy vs New Input System)\n- One-time startup diagnostic in Update() to verify MonoBehaviour lifecycle\n\n### Fixed\n- Spectator mode: disable colliders when entering, re-enable when exiting\n- Currency sync: calculate delta from current amount to prevent desync\n- Added ExitSpectatorMode() method\n\n### Changed\n- Improved UDP host note in menu\n- Enhanced packet ordering comments\n\n**IMPORTANT:** After launching the game, check BepInEx/LogOutput.log for [Coop] diagnostic messages that will help identify the F10/F11 issue."
